pkg:Evidence_v1_49_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.49.0 (STORY-10 closed: real tiered parallel dispatch)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: STORY-10's core parallelization goal implemented and closed, per owner's explicit confirmation. Re-examined the existing begin/finish/paint UI mechanism directly, confirming it already supports genuine parallel tiers with zero rewrite needed -- corrected an earlier, more pessimistic assessment. Restructured runRequestIntakeAgent into the real, already-mapped 4 tiers via Promise.allSettled, each gated only on its own real dependencies. Two real bugs (a duplicate declaration, an accidental deletion) caught and fixed before verification via the page failing to load. Verified with real measurement: a purpose-built mock LLM server with performance.now() instrumentation confirmed genuinely overlapping call windows in Tier 1, and the full real pipeline ran to completion through all 11 stages (real Pyodide execution, real pyshacl validation, a real deployed state). 24/24 regression suite, 0 errors. Separately, corrected STORY-18's prior flawed reasoning per a valid owner objection, narrowing it to real, disclosed research directions (a stronger external model; VAF's ontology-driven synthesis) rather than a closed 'not now'. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS (68 subjects, reproduces), register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "c52c280bf8d5b4d1fad9c611cf817cc33946eacf1678a0729feaa123a88fed06"^^xsd:string .
